                  "function_response": null,
                  "inline_data": null,
                  "text": "Hello! I'm your Smart Eco-Travel Concierge, here to help you plan a trip that's as green as it is enjoyable. Think of me as your personal travel coordinator.\n\nI can assist you with:\n\n*   **Eco-Friendly Route Planning:** I can find the best transit options, compare costs, and calculate the carbon footprint of your journey to help you travel more sustainably.\n*   **Personalized Itineraries:** Whether you're looking for hidden gems or must-see attractions, I can build a daily schedule tailored to your interests.\n*   **Weather & Packing Advice:** I'll keep you updated on the forecast for your destination and suggest exactly what you should pack to stay comfortable.\n\nHow can I help you start planning your next adventure today?",
